{"id":"b4588e429e73283a","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-quantum-circuit.md","title":"Quantum Circuit","display":"df-quantum-circuit — Quantum Circuit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-quantum-circuit","aliases":["28-df-quantum-circuit","Quantum Circuit"],"display":"df-quantum-circuit — Quantum Circuit","depends_on":["[[28-df-quantum-gate]]","[[28-df-quantum-state]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 10.9 and §10.3.6","source_printed_pages":"213–215","source_pdf_pages":"239–241","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-quantum-circuit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-quantum-circuit</span><span>Quantum Circuit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantum-circuit — Quantum Circuit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dec9a25527c3b8b7\" href=\"?note=dec9a25527c3b8b7\" title=\"28-df-quantum-gate\">28-df-quantum-gate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b69949a89b41b967\" href=\"?note=b69949a89b41b967\" title=\"28-df-quantum-state\">28-df-quantum-state</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 10.9 and §10.3.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"213–215"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"239–241"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{QGate}_q\">\\(\\mathbf{QGate}_q\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dec9a25527c3b8b7\" href=\"?note=dec9a25527c3b8b7\" title=\"28-df-quantum-gate\">28-df-quantum-gate</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_m,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_m)\">\\(\\mathcal H_m,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_m)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b69949a89b41b967\" href=\"?note=b69949a89b41b967\" title=\"28-df-quantum-state\">28-df-quantum-state</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(m,((q_i,U_i,S_i))_{i=1}^T)\">\\(C=(m,((q_i,U_i,S_i))_{i=1}^T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_i=(s_{i,1},\\ldots,s_{i,q_i})\">\\(S_i=(s_{i,1},\\ldots,s_{i,q_i})\\)</span> 为有序互异线路编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_Q\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_Q\\)</span> 由下式的门库编号、线路整数表构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\)</span> 是自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>；邻接字串表示连接，空表连接为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,S,T_3\">\\(H,S,T_3\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dec9a25527c3b8b7\" href=\"?note=dec9a25527c3b8b7\" title=\"28-df-quantum-gate\">28-df-quantum-gate</a> 中的三个指定门。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;C_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\">\\(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;C_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde U_{i;S_i}\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_m)\">\\(\\widetilde U_{i;S_i}\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_m)\\)</span> 是下式在计算基上的作用唯一线性延拓所得的算子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{q_i}\">\\(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{q_i}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[T]\">\\(i\\in[T]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in[q_i]\">\\(j\\in[q_i]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in[m]\">\\(s\\in[m]\\)</span>；态演化函数只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\">\\(C\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_m)\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_m)\\)</span> 定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\\coloneqq\\{(m,((q_i,U_i,S_i))_{i=1}^T):T\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\forall i\\in[T]\\ [(q_i,U_i)\\in\\mathcal G\\land S_i\\in[m]^{q_i}\\land\\forall j,k\\in[q_i]\\ (j\\ne k\\Rightarrow s_{i,j}\\ne s_{i,k})]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\\coloneqq\\{(m,((q_i,U_i,S_i))_{i=1}^T):T\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\forall i\\in[T]\\ [(q_i,U_i)\\in\\mathcal G\\land S_i\\in[m]^{q_i}\\land\\forall j,k\\in[q_i]\\ (j\\ne k\\Rightarrow s_{i,j}\\ne s_{i,k})]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde U_{i;S_i}|x\\rangle\\coloneqq\\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{q_i}}(U_i)_{y,x|_{S_i}}\\,|x[S_i\\leftarrow y]\\rangle,\\qquad x|_{S_i}\\coloneqq(x_{s_{i,1}},\\ldots,x_{s_{i,q_i}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widetilde U_{i;S_i}|x\\rangle\\coloneqq\\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{q_i}}(U_i)_{y,x|_{S_i}}\\,|x[S_i\\leftarrow y]\\rangle,\\qquad x|_{S_i}\\coloneqq(x_{s_{i,1}},\\ldots,x_{s_{i,q_i}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x[S_i\\leftarrow y]_{s_{i,j}}\\coloneqq y_j,\\qquad x[S_i\\leftarrow y]_s\\coloneqq x_s\\quad(s\\notin\\{s_{i,1},\\ldots,s_{i,q_i}\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x[S_i\\leftarrow y]_{s_{i,j}}\\coloneqq y_j,\\qquad x[S_i\\leftarrow y]_s\\coloneqq x_s\\quad(s\\notin\\{s_{i,1},\\ldots,s_{i,q_i}\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_C\\coloneqq\\widetilde U_{T;S_T}\\cdots\\widetilde U_{1;S_1},\\qquad\\operatorname{Out}_C(\\rho)\\coloneqq U_C\\rho U_C^\\dagger,\\qquad\\operatorname{size}(C)\\coloneqq T,\\qquad U_{(m,\\epsilon)}\\coloneqq I_{2^m}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_C\\coloneqq\\widetilde U_{T;S_T}\\cdots\\widetilde U_{1;S_1},\\qquad\\operatorname{Out}_C(\\rho)\\coloneqq U_C\\rho U_C^\\dagger,\\qquad\\operatorname{size}(C)\\coloneqq T,\\qquad U_{(m,\\epsilon)}\\coloneqq I_{2^m}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_Q(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(1,H)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(1,S)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(3,T_3)\\coloneqq2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{nat}_Q(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(1,H)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(1,S)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(3,T_3)\\coloneqq2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{entry}_Q(q,U,(s_1,\\ldots,s_q))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_Q(q)\\operatorname{nat}_Q(\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(q,U))\\operatorname{nat}_Q(s_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{nat}_Q(s_q)\\quad((q,U)\\in\\mathcal G,\\ (s_1,\\ldots,s_q)\\in[m]^q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{entry}_Q(q,U,(s_1,\\ldots,s_q))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_Q(q)\\operatorname{nat}_Q(\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(q,U))\\operatorname{nat}_Q(s_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{nat}_Q(s_q)\\quad((q,U)\\in\\mathcal G,\\ (s_1,\\ldots,s_q)\\in[m]^q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_Q(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_Q(m)\\operatorname{nat}_Q(T)\\operatorname{entry}_Q(q_1,U_1,S_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{entry}_Q(q_T,U_T,S_T)\\quad(C=(m,((q_i,U_i,S_i))_{i=1}^T)\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_Q(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_Q(m)\\operatorname{nat}_Q(T)\\operatorname{entry}_Q(q_1,U_1,S_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{entry}_Q(q_T,U_T,S_T)\\quad(C=(m,((q_i,U_i,S_i))_{i=1}^T)\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ G(1^n)=\\operatorname{enc}_Q(C_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ G(1^n)=\\operatorname{enc}_Q(C_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>指定有序线路插入的矩阵元构造，故局部门的扩张不再仅由 Remark 说明。每步扩张幺正，空电路为恒等。QU 要求经典多项式时间统一生成整条量子门列表，与经典 LU 不是同一类型接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 10.9 and §10.3.6，印刷页 213–215；PDF 页 239–241。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R7：线路互异条件显式量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k\\in[q_i]\">\\(j,k\\in[q_i]\\)</span>，与有序线路表的坐标域一致；原来未限域的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\ne k\">\\(j\\ne k\\)</span> 写法无法保证坐标调用良定义。</p>\n<p>编码边界：门库编号和全部线路端口由前缀码逐项记录，不附加填充。解码、元数检查及线路范围检查在码长的多项式时间内完成；其长度与显式门表总二进制长度线性相互有界。因此 QU 的统一生成含义由正式构造确定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-quantum-gate","status":"resolved","id":"dec9a25527c3b8b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-quantum-gate]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-state","status":"resolved","id":"b69949a89b41b967","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-quantum-state]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-gate","status":"resolved","id":"dec9a25527c3b8b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal G$、$\\mathbf{QGate}_q$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-gate]]；$\\mathcal H_m,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_m)$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-state","status":"resolved","id":"b69949a89b41b967","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal G$、$\\mathbf{QGate}_q$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-gate]]；$\\mathcal H_m,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_m)$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-gate","status":"resolved","id":"dec9a25527c3b8b7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"候选 $C=(m,((q_i,U_i,S_i))_{i=1}^T)$，$S_i=(s_{i,1},\\ldots,s_{i,q_i})$ 为有序互异线路编号；$\\operatorname{enc}_Q$ 由下式的门库编号、线路整数表构造。$\\operatorname{bin}(j)$ 是自然数 $j$ 的无前导零二进制表示，$\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0$；邻接字串表示连接，空表连接为 $\\epsilon$；$H,S,T_3$ 是 [[28-df-quantum-gate]] 中的三个指定门。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；$\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ 满足 $\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;C_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{QGate}_q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_m,\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_m)","display":false},{"tex":"C=(m,((q_i,U_i,S_i))_{i=1}^T)","display":false},{"tex":"S_i=(s_{i,1},\\ldots,s_{i,q_i})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"H,S,T_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=(C_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;C_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde U_{i;S_i}\\in\\operatorname{End}(\\mathcal H_m)","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{q_i}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[T]","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in[q_i]","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in[m]","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\\coloneqq\\{(m,((q_i,U_i,S_i))_{i=1}^T):T\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\forall i\\in[T]\\ [(q_i,U_i)\\in\\mathcal G\\land S_i\\in[m]^{q_i}\\land\\forall j,k\\in[q_i]\\ (j\\ne k\\Rightarrow s_{i,j}\\ne s_{i,k})]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widetilde U_{i;S_i}|x\\rangle\\coloneqq\\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{q_i}}(U_i)_{y,x|_{S_i}}\\,|x[S_i\\leftarrow y]\\rangle,\\qquad x|_{S_i}\\coloneqq(x_{s_{i,1}},\\ldots,x_{s_{i,q_i}}).","display":true},{"tex":"x[S_i\\leftarrow y]_{s_{i,j}}\\coloneqq y_j,\\qquad x[S_i\\leftarrow y]_s\\coloneqq x_s\\quad(s\\notin\\{s_{i,1},\\ldots,s_{i,q_i}\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"U_C\\coloneqq\\widetilde U_{T;S_T}\\cdots\\widetilde U_{1;S_1},\\qquad\\operatorname{Out}_C(\\rho)\\coloneqq U_C\\rho U_C^\\dagger,\\qquad\\operatorname{size}(C)\\coloneqq T,\\qquad U_{(m,\\epsilon)}\\coloneqq I_{2^m}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_Q(j)\\coloneqq1^{|\\operatorname{bin}(j)|}0\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(1,H)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(1,S)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(3,T_3)\\coloneqq2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{entry}_Q(q,U,(s_1,\\ldots,s_q))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_Q(q)\\operatorname{nat}_Q(\\operatorname{code}_{\\mathcal G}(q,U))\\operatorname{nat}_Q(s_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{nat}_Q(s_q)\\quad((q,U)\\in\\mathcal G,\\ (s_1,\\ldots,s_q)\\in[m]^q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_Q(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_Q(m)\\operatorname{nat}_Q(T)\\operatorname{entry}_Q(q_1,U_1,S_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{entry}_Q(q_T,U_T,S_T)\\quad(C=(m,((q_i,U_i,S_i))_{i=1}^T)\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ G(1^n)=\\operatorname{enc}_Q(C_n).","display":true},{"tex":"j,k\\in[q_i]","display":false},{"tex":"j\\ne k","display":false}],"bytes":4180,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0486b96e648a9d6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{QU}$、$\\operatorname{Out}$、$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；$E_{\\mathsf{acc},m}$ 见 [[28-df-measurement]]。"},{"id":"c994a65ad9a02350","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{QU}$、$\\operatorname{Out}$、$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；密度算子与接受投影见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]、[[28-df-measurement]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计算模型：[[28-df-quantum-gate]]、[[28-df-quantum-circuit]]。"},{"id":"9a7e2d6d7ea972c3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{BQP}$、$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{Out}_C$、$\\operatorname{QU}$ 见 [[28-df-bqp]]、[[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]。\n$\\operatorname{bin}(N)$ 为正整数 $N$ 的无前导零二进制表示，$\\mathbb N[n]$ 是非负整数系数一元多项式集合；空乘积取 $1$。$C\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$x\\in\\Sigma^{\\le m}$；$\\operatorname{QOut}_C(x)$ 是值域 $\\Sigma^m$ 的随机变量，其概率质量由下式定义。\n$\\operatorname{Prime}$、正整数对序列集合 $\\mathcal T$、质因数分解关系 $\\mathsf{PF}$ 及列表编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{pf}}$ 均在下式内定义。$\\mathcal V=(V_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$，$G\\in\\mathbf{FP}$ 为确定型测量后处理算法；字串乘积按序拼接。"}],"outgoing":["dec9a25527c3b8b7","b69949a89b41b967","adb92775ec020a0b"]}